    "description": "<p>Acquired with CR11 or higher. The target gains the [Aquatic] tag, and [Cancel (Aquatic): 20]. Treat this effect as a Combat Status.</p>\n<p>(CR21): Increase the [Cancel] to 30.<br>(Fate 1): If you have reached your Limit for this skill, you may pay this cost to use it again.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>A magic that grants the protection of water to your friends and yourself, allowing them to move freely in the water as well as on land, if not more.</p>",
